      "text": [
        "Everything your website needs, in one plan",
        "Most small businesses don't need a big agency — they need a site that works, loads fast, and gets looked after. That's what we do, and only that.",
        "Custom design & build",
        "A site designed around your business, not a recycled template — built to load fast and look right on every phone and screen.",
        "Local SEO foundations",
        "Proper page titles, structured data and a Google Business Profile set-up so people searching nearby can actually find you.",
        "Bookings & online orders",
        "Booking calendars, enquiry forms or simple online ordering — connected to the tools you already use, like WhatsApp or email.",
        "Hosting, backups & security",
        "Your site lives on fast UK/EU servers with daily backups, SSL and monitoring — all included, all handled by us.",
        "Ongoing updates",
        "Need a new opening time, a price change or a fresh photo added? Just email us — small changes are included every month.",
        "Monthly reporting",
        "A short, plain-English report each month on visitors, enquiries and what we've changed — no dashboards to figure out yourself.",
        "What we do"
