      "text": [
        "Small businesses, real results",
        "\"Our old site hadn't been touched in years. Doman rebuilt it, sorted our Google listing, and bookings have gone up every month since. I don't have to think about it — I just email if something needs changing.\"",
        "\"I liked that there wasn't a scary contract. The monthly plan is clear, the site loads instantly, and when I asked for the menu to be updated it was done the same day.\"",
        "\"We compared quotes from three agencies. Doman was the only one that actually explained hosting and updates in plain English rather than burying it in the small print.\"",
        "What clients say",
